OL,5,G1800 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FLive from The Glasshouse, the BBC
OL,7,     FScottish Symphony Orchestra
OL,8,     Fcelebrates the music of Steve
OL,9,     FReich with four landmark works,
OL,10,     Fconducted by Colin Currie with
OL,11,     Fguitarist Bryce Dessner.
OL,12,G2030 Sunday Feature: It's gonna rain
OL,13,     FPaul Farley was born in the year
OL,14,     FSteve Reich released 'It's Gonna
OL,15,     FRain'. By way of a birthday
OL,16,     Fpresent to himself, he explores
OL,17,     Fthe piece that gifted phasing to
OL,18,     Fthe musical world.
